 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "1 · Refused before it's written",
   "items": [
    "B's PreToolUse hook sends a side-effect-free check; the coordinator rejects it: B calls createSession, whose signature A changed in #3 after B's base #1",
    "The adapter fetches event #3 and quotes A's diff in the deny reason: -createSession(userId) +createSession(userId, opts)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "2 · Reroute or negotiate · 3 · priority",
   "items": [
    "Reroute: B adapts the call and its next check is accepted (M1 run: Codex passed { ttlMs })",
    "Negotiate: an accepted overload is binding; A's stop gate refuses until A delivers it",
    "Both writing one symbol: seniority = task priority, then first accepted event; wound-wait by default, wait-die per repo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "4 · Structural merge · 5 · land",
   "items": [
    "Every push is rebased in a sandbox: plain git, then Mergiraf, then a resolver agent; what is still conflicted bounces to the agent",
    "LandChange waits its turn in the repo's submit queue, then pushes trunk with --force-with-lease: a lost race is stale_trunk and retries",
    "Otto run-4: 6 squiggles, all rerouted; one Mergiraf merge; all 7 cards landed"
   ]
  }
 ]
